                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/3729: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Dennis</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-08-26T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 26,
                                1926—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>61. U.S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Tulsa</hi> has been ordered to Corinto, and
                    U.S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Galveston</hi> to Bluefields.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
